 <!--- 1/23/05 ---><tr valign="top">
<td width="760" colspan="2" class="bigyellow">March 1, 2005 - A Change in Planes... err .. plans.<br><img src="/images/line.gif" width="760" height="2" border="0" alt=""></td>
<tr valign="top">
<td width="150"><img src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/sidenews.gif" width="150" height="300" border="0" alt=""></td>
<td><div align="left">Sol Ro's uber new 'Crash Zone' AE was a little too irritating for us to deal with this past couple of weeks,
so fire has to wait. Did we sit on our duffs? Nope. Ilainya said, 'Hey, you better
get KT flagged, because we are going to raid Ikkiniz on Monday.' So it was written, and so it
came to pass.... <br>
<br>

<center><img src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/ikkiani.gif"></center>
<br>Bah.. doing the Trial of Righteousness the first time and winning it not enough you say? We didn't think
so either. We also paid a visit to Ferubi to kill the Packmaster and Zun'Muram, then moved on to
Wall of Slaughter to kill Veliktorin, and Hulcror. Uber Bazu skin makes nice rugs for
our guild hall you know, and 3 more first time kills gives you that warm fuzzy feeling.
Oh yeah, we also had to slap around a few snakes for old time's sake.<br><br>

Congratulations HA on your teamwork and success! Your effort makes this possible!<br>
<br>
<font color="#ffff00">- Guildor</font><br>
<br>
</div></td>
</tr> 
<tr valign="top">
<td width="760" colspan="2" class="bigyellow">February 14, 2005 - Welcome back to the Elemental Planes!<br><img src="/images/line.gif" width="760" height="2" border="0" alt=""></td>
<tr valign="top">
<td width="150"><img src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/asedead.jpg" width="150" height="300" border="0" alt=""></td>
<td><div align="left">Soooo much to report : Emp,
VT, RZtW ( the game crashed on first kill, right after XP message. Ooookaaayy /rude
SOE.. we'll do it again! <br>2 more epic 1.5s (Gratz Guildor and Vadrigar),
KT flags, Elemental access for nearly everyone!!! <br><br>Thanks to the incredible
raid leadership of Ilainya and Xaleban, and the awesome execution and
dedication of its members, House Archon wasted nearly every single flag
mob and event in a record time of 6 consecutive nights!! On our first visit
back to the elemental planes as a guild, we stomped all 4 earth rings
<i>and</i> the MAoE.<br><br>Gratz HA on your hard work and sweet loots. See
you in Earth B, and soon... the Plane of FIRE! <br>
<br>
<font color="#ffff00">- Guildor</font><br>
<br>
<center><img src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/grum.jpg" width="250" height="318" border="0" alt="">
<img src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/maoe.jpg" width="190" height="318" border="0" alt=""><br>
<img src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/agnardead.jpg" width="330" height="210" border="0" alt="">
<img src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/bert.jpg" width="400" height="190" border="0" alt=""></center>
OK, so I'm missing some screenshots...We don't have space for all of them!<br>
<center><img src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/rdkill1.jpg" width="500" height="287" border="0" alt=""><br></center>
<br>
<br>
</div></td>
</tr>
 <!--1/22/05-->        
 <tr vAlign="top">
              <td class="bigyellow" width="810" colSpan="2">January 22, 2005 -
                The House Rebuilds.. <br>
                <img src="/images/line.gif" width="760" height="2" border="0" alt=""></td>
            <tr>
              <td width="251"><img alt src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/ahr1.jpg" border="0" width="235" height="273">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
              </td>
              <td width="553" valign="top" align="left">
                <p align="left">Over the past month we've seen our average
                online numbers jump to more than triple what they were in
                November!&nbsp; With quality recruits joining us weekly, and a
                drive to fulfill our goals binding us, success WILL be
                ours!&nbsp; In less than one month we've keyed and sharded over
                15 new members, killed Emp TWICE, took the initiative to gain
                alternate access to Solsek Ro's tower, and won an epic 1.5's (
                gratz Raccoo).&nbsp; Congratulations on your hard work
                HA!&nbsp;&nbsp; Where is HA going next?&nbsp; Join us and find
                out!&nbsp; Contact Ilainya, Guildor, Araon, Tsunan, Arxael,
                Sehnea, Xaleban or Ouruk soon! </p>
                <p align="left"><font color="#ffff00">- Guildor</font></p>
                <p align="left"><br>
                <img border="0" src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/ahr3.jpg" width="450" height="353"></p>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr vAlign="top">
              <td class="bigyellow" width="810" colSpan="2"></td>
            <tr vAlign="top">
              <td class="bigyellow" width="810" colSpan="2">January 19, 2005 -
                Emporer Dies... 2x in 1 week... Cursed 2x in 24 hours...<br>
                <img src="/images/line.gif" width="760" height="2" border="0" alt=""></td>
            <tr>
              <td width="251" valign="top" align="left">We've set our goals
                quickly and we are accomplishing them.&nbsp; Gratz on Emp x 2..
                looking forward to kills 10, 11, 12....&nbsp; Oh and BTW.. gratz
                Cavall.&nbsp; Your new threads are stylin'!
                <p><font color="#ffff00">- Guildor</font></p>
                &nbsp;&nbsp; </td>
              <td width="553" valign="top" align="left">&nbsp;<img border="0" src="http://home.cinci.rr.com/mwalson/emp1.jpg" align="top" width="400" height="238"></td>
            </tr>

<!--- 10/13/04 --->			
			<tr valign="top">
				<td width="760" colspan="2" class="bigyellow">December 13th, 2004 - A New Era Begins...<br><img src="/images/line.gif" width="760" height="2" border="0" alt=""></td>
			<tr valign="top">
			<td width="150"><img src="/images/Xegony/Xegony.jpg" width="150" height="150" border="0" alt=""></td>
				<td>  

The recent release of EQ2, WoW and the slow retirement of many longtime
 EQ players has changed the face of EQ more in the past 2 months than in any time in its 
 history. House Archon was on the verge of breaking into the Plane of Time when this tragedy
  struck - scattering our members across the virtual realms and snatching certain victory
   from our grasp. What is done is done however - it is time to move on - to rebuild.<br><br>
   
House Archon has a long distinguished history on the Torv server as a guild of 
skilled, competent and friendly people. A solid core of these players remain
 - faithful, strong, and dedicated. It is time to step out of the shadow of 
 recent events and bring these qualities to the forefront again. It is time to 
 begin a new era for House Archon that will see us move into PoTime and beyond! 
 Do you wish to participate? Our doors our open! Welcome to our new home.<br><br>

<font color="#FFFF00">- Guildor, Arxael, Tsunan, Masterfyst, Araon, Muislo</font> <br><br><br>

			</td>
			</tr>
	
